---
description: StellarCade contribution rules for AI-written changes
alwaysApply: true
---

Before editing, read `AGENTS.md` at the repo root and the `AGENTS.md` in each
area you touch (`contracts/AGENTS.md`, `backend/AGENTS.md`,
`apps/web/AGENTS.md`). They are the source of truth; this file only points
to them.

Non-negotiables:

- Work from linked GitHub issues (one `Closes #N` line each; related issues
  may share a PR). Edit only the files in their
  **Where to Implement (Exact Targets)** sections.
- Never simulate game outcomes, fabricate transaction hashes, or leave
  placeholder code that looks finished. Return an honest error instead.
- `soroban-sdk` 25.x + `#[contractevent]`, `stellar` CLI (not `soroban`),
  `wasm32v1-none`, `@stellar/stellar-sdk` v14 `rpc` namespace, Next.js 16.
- Run the checks in `AGENTS.md` → *Delivery Standard* and paste their
  output into the PR template.
